OL,4,CCost of living roadshow highlights     
OL,5,Csupport on offer                       
OL,6,GA cost of living roadshow held in a    
OL,7,GKent town is the "starting point" and  
OL,8,G"first step on the ladder" to resolve  
OL,9,Gfinancial problems, a local councillor 
OL,10,Ghas said.                              
OL,12,FOrganisations, including those which   
OL,13,Fhelp people with health and wellbeing, 
OL,14,Fmanaging bills and getting back into   
OL,15,Fwork, have been in Sheerness for the   
OL,16,FSwale Borough Council event on         
OL,17,FThursday morning.                      
OL,19,FThis event, funded by the Crisis and   
OL,20,FResilience Fund which helps households 
OL,21,Ffacing financial crisis,               
